; PROJECT NEBULA — Ship Builder test harness.
;
; Authored as text rather than through the editor so the structure is reviewable in
; a diff. Three rules govern it:
;
;   1. Every node a script reaches for is marked unique_name_in_owner, so scripts
;      address them as %Name and the tree can be rearranged without touching code.
;   2. The 3D lives in a SubViewport whose container IS the BuilderViewport, so pick
;      rays, framing and drop targets all use the same rectangle the player sees.
;   3. Panels are plain children of the root scene, so `owner as BuilderRoot` finds
;      the single mutation path from any depth.

